{"id":"68817150a3172cfd","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-grothendieck.md","title":"分裂投影与纤维同构","display":"thm-grothendieck-construction — 分裂投影与纤维同构","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-thm-grothendieck","aliases":["16-thm-grothendieck","16-thm--grothendieck"],"display":"thm-grothendieck-construction — 分裂投影与纤维同构","depends_on":["[[16-df-split-fibration]]","[[16-df-functor]]","[[16-df-grothendieck-construction]]","[[16-df-fibre]]"],"source":"Proposition 1.10.2(i),(iii), p. 108 (PDF 128); strict case expanded locally","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-grothendieck"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-grothendieck</span><span>16-thm--grothendieck</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-grothendieck-construction — 分裂投影与纤维同构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" href=\"?note=eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration\">16-df-split-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"43c81e33a22655f0\" href=\"?note=43c81e33a22655f0\" title=\"16-df-grothendieck-construction\">16-df-grothendieck-construction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"aa1ce0bab1ae8910\" href=\"?note=aa1ce0bab1ae8910\" title=\"16-df-fibre\">16-df-fibre</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Proposition 1.10.2(i),(iii), p. 108 (PDF 128); strict case expanded locally"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(F,\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(F,\\mathcal B)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\int F,p_F,\\kappa_F\">\\(\\int F,p_F,\\kappa_F\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"43c81e33a22655f0\" href=\"?note=43c81e33a22655f0\" title=\"16-df-grothendieck-construction\">16-df-grothendieck-construction</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\">\\(I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\int F)_I\">\\((\\int F)_I\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"aa1ce0bab1ae8910\" href=\"?note=aa1ce0bab1ae8910\" title=\"16-df-fibre\">16-df-fibre</a> 的纤维；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_I\">\\(T_I\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_I\">\\(S_I\\)</span> 是下文构造的函子。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" href=\"?note=eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration\">16-df-split-fibration</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nT_I(I,X)&amp;\\coloneqq X,\n\\qquad T_I\\langle(I,X),(I,Y),\\operatorname{id}_I,f\\rangle\\coloneqq f,\\\\\nS_I(X)&amp;\\coloneqq(I,X),\n\\qquad S_I(f:X\\to Y)\\coloneqq\n\\langle(I,X),(I,Y),\\operatorname{id}_I,f\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(T_I,(\\textstyle\\int F)_I,F(I))&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(S_I,F(I),(\\textstyle\\int F)_I),\\\\\nT_IS_I&amp;=\\operatorname{Id}_{F(I)},\n\\qquad S_IT_I=\\operatorname{Id}_{(\\int F)_I},\\\\\n\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p_F,\\kappa_F)&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nT_I(I,X)&amp;\\coloneqq X,\n\\qquad T_I\\langle(I,X),(I,Y),\\operatorname{id}_I,f\\rangle\\coloneqq f,\\\\\nS_I(X)&amp;\\coloneqq(I,X),\n\\qquad S_I(f:X\\to Y)\\coloneqq\n\\langle(I,X),(I,Y),\\operatorname{id}_I,f\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(T_I,(\\textstyle\\int F)_I,F(I))&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(S_I,F(I),(\\textstyle\\int F)_I),\\\\\nT_IS_I&amp;=\\operatorname{Id}_{F(I)},\n\\qquad S_IT_I=\\operatorname{Id}_{(\\int F)_I},\\\\\n\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p_F,\\kappa_F)&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>严格性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(\\operatorname{id}_I)=\\operatorname{Id}\">\\(F(\\operatorname{id}_I)=\\operatorname{Id}\\)</span>，所以纤维中的箭头恰为所列标签记录，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_I,S_I\">\\(T_I,S_I\\)</span> 逐分量互逆；这给范畴同构而不是对象集的字面相等。</li>\n<li>本页是 Proposition 1.10.2 的严格实例；Theorem 1.10.7 所述完整对应的固定基范畴接口见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3af0cd796b55bbd7\" href=\"?note=3af0cd796b55bbd7\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration-category\">16-df-split-fibration-category</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-split-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"eb3d8d8bfc151af6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-split-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-grothendieck-construction","status":"resolved","id":"43c81e33a22655f0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-grothendieck-construction]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibre","status":"resolved","id":"aa1ce0bab1ae8910","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibre]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-grothendieck-construction","status":"resolved","id":"43c81e33a22655f0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(F,\\mathcal B)$，$\\int F,p_F,\\kappa_F$ 采用 [[16-df-grothendieck-construction]]；$I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibre","status":"resolved","id":"aa1ce0bab1ae8910","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\int F)_I$ 是 [[16-df-fibre]] 的纤维；$T_I$、$S_I$ 是下文构造的函子。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}$ 与 $\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)$ 分别采用 [[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-split-fibration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"eb3d8d8bfc151af6","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}$ 与 $\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)$ 分别采用 [[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-split-fibration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-fibration-category","status":"resolved","id":"3af0cd796b55bbd7","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本页是 Proposition 1.10.2 的严格实例；Theorem 1.10.7 所述完整对应的固定基范畴接口见 [[16-df-split-fibration-category]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(F,\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\int F,p_F,\\kappa_F","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"(\\int F)_I","display":false},{"tex":"T_I","display":false},{"tex":"S_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nT_I(I,X)&\\coloneqq X,\n\\qquad T_I\\langle(I,X),(I,Y),\\operatorname{id}_I,f\\rangle\\coloneqq f,\\\\\nS_I(X)&\\coloneqq(I,X),\n\\qquad S_I(f:X\\to Y)\\coloneqq\n\\langle(I,X),(I,Y),\\operatorname{id}_I,f\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(T_I,(\\textstyle\\int F)_I,F(I))&,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(S_I,F(I),(\\textstyle\\int F)_I),\\\\\nT_IS_I&=\\operatorname{Id}_{F(I)},\n\\qquad S_IT_I=\\operatorname{Id}_{(\\int F)_I},\\\\\n\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p_F,\\kappa_F)&.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"F(\\operatorname{id}_I)=\\operatorname{Id}","display":false},{"tex":"T_I,S_I","display":false}],"bytes":1765,"backlinks":[{"id":"3af0cd796b55bbd7","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$K_S:\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa)\\to\\mathcal E$ 采用 [[16-df-grothendieck-total-category]]，$T_I:(\\int F)_I\\to F(I)$ 采用 [[16-thm-grothendieck]]；两者分别用于末行自然同构的分量。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-426","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-thm-grothendieck|thm-grothendieck-construction — 分裂投影与纤维同构]]"}],"outgoing":["eb3d8d8bfc151af6","fc49efccd7348d66","43c81e33a22655f0","aa1ce0bab1ae8910","3af0cd796b55bbd7"]}